{"title": "Pralhad Joshi Appointed New Union Education Minister", "summary": "Pralhad Joshi, currently the Union Minister for Food and Consumer Affairs, has been given the additional charge of the Ministry of Education. This appointment follows the resignation of Dharmendra Pradhan. Joshi, a five-time Member of Parliament, has stated his commitment to fulfilling the responsibilities entrusted to him.", "summary_points": ["Pralhad Joshi has been appointed as the new Union Education Minister.", "He will hold the additional charge of the Education Ministry.", "This comes after the resignation of the previous minister, Dharmendra Pradhan.", "Joshi is a five-time Member of Parliament.", "He has expressed his commitment to discharging his duties with dedication."], "title_hi": "प्रह्लाद जोशी नए केंद्रीय शिक्षा मंत्री नियुक्त", "summary_hi": "खाद्य और उपभोक्ता मामलों के वर्तमान केंद्रीय मंत्री प्रह्लाद जोशी को शिक्षा मंत्रालय का अतिरिक्त प्रभार सौंपा गया है। यह नियुक्ति निवर्तमान मंत्री धर्मेंद्र प्रधान के इस्तीफे के बाद हुई है। पांच बार के सांसद जोशी ने उन्हें सौंपी गई जिम्मेदारियों को पूरी निष्ठा से निभाने की प्रतिबद्धता जताई है।", "summary_points_hi": ["प्रह्लाद जोशी को नए केंद्रीय शिक्षा मंत्री के रूप में नियुक्त किया गया है।", "वह शिक्षा मंत्रालय का अतिरिक्त प्रभार संभालेंगे।", "यह नियुक्ति पिछले मंत्री धर्मेंद्र प्रधान के इस्तीफे के बाद हुई है।", "जोशी पांच बार के सांसद हैं।", "उन्होंने निष्ठापूर्वक अपने कर्तव्यों का निर्वहन करने की प्रतिबद्धता व्यक्त की है।"], "framing": {"center": "Centrist coverage focuses on the appointment of Pralhad Joshi as the new Education Minister, highlighting his background and his commitment to the role following Dharmendra Pradhan's resignation. Outlets also provide context on Joshi's political journey.", "right": "Right-leaning coverage emphasizes Pralhad Joshi's experience as a five-time MP and his significant responsibilities within the Modi government, framing his appointment as a continuation of his service."}, "framing_hi": {"center": "केंद्रवादी कवरेज प्रह्लाद जोशी की नए शिक्षा मंत्री के रूप में नियुक्ति पर केंद्रित है, जिसमें धर्मेंद्र प्रधान के इस्तीफे के बाद उनकी पृष्ठभूमि और भूमिका के प्रति उनकी प्रतिबद्धता पर प्रकाश डाला गया है। आउटलेट्स जोशी की राजनीतिक यात्रा पर भी संदर्भ प्रदान करते हैं।", "right": "दक्षिणपंथी कवरेज पांच बार के सांसद के रूप में प्रह्लाद जोशी के अनुभव और मोदी सरकार में उनकी महत्वपूर्ण जिम्मेदारियों पर जोर देती है, उनकी नियुक्ति को उनकी सेवा की निरंतरता के रूप में प्रस्तुत करती है।"}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://c.ndtvimg.com/2022-02/i343ph9o_pralhad-joshi_625x300_03_February_22.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "NDTV", "owner": "NDTV", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.ndtv.com/india-news/pralhad-joshi-gets-additional-charge-of-education-ministry-after-dharmendra-pradhan-resigns-11821626", "headline": "Pralhad Joshi Appointed Education Minister After Dharmendra Pradhan Quits"}, {"source": "NDTV", "owner": "NDTV", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.ndtv.com/india-news/student-leader-to-mp-to-education-minister-pralhad-joshis-journey-11821881", "headline": "Student Leader To MP To Education Minister: Pralhad Joshi's Journey"}, {"source": "Scroll.in", "owner": "Scroll.in", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Updates: Dharmendra Pradhan resigns as education minister, Pralhad Joshi to replace him"}, {"source": "Dainik Jagran", "owner": "Jagran Group", "lean": "right", "language": "hi", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "पांच बार के सांसद हैं प्रल्हाद जोशी, मोदी सरकार में संभाली अहम जिम्मेदारियां; ऐसा रहा है सियासी सफर - who is pralhad joshi given additional charge of the union ministry of education following dharmendra pradhans resign"}, {"source": "Amar Ujala", "owner": "Amar Ujala", "lean": "center", "language": "hi", "url": "https://www.amarujala.com/india-news/discharge-my-responsibilities-with-utmost-dedication-prahlad-joshi-speak-after